{"title":"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_9\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 9</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\">Problem 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the figure, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/c/e4c044326e2e84b768dafef07060bd42b0a5cb21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> square, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbb4c52e011ceed6e813118a7d59e931af444a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f32db217d7630882c3441fa8821cd70a6958c3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/7/bc7f4fd0e5897e8ac812a9a562556b8cdd87341f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{CF}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> is perpendicular to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f32db217d7630882c3441fa8821cd70a6958c3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />, then the area of quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/28283830381a9931fc4e44deac6f63dc43a61889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CDEF$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/d/3add3e3db4df44fb9e6b649e2ef26e0b838cf27d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt)); dotfactor=4; pair A = (0,2); pair B = origin; pair C = (2,0); pair D = (2,2); pair E = midpoint(A--D); pair F = foot(C,B,E); dot(A);dot(B);dot(C);dot(D);dot(E);dot(F); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,N);label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,S);label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,S);label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,N);label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,N);label(&quot;$F$&quot;,F,NW); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle); draw(B--E); draw(C--F); draw(rightanglemark(B,F,C,4));[/asy]\" width=\"228\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/9/3c92970df9e312c5fd3dfcda8a19fa603e86a5b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 3-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{11}{5}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\sqrt{5}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{9}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"430\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/0/1b012534de8bfbff5170389574d0df4a6b7ddab0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EBA = \\angle FCB$\" width=\"135\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/d/cbd5c71dece806ae78d789493204a10cb625ee49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle FBC = \\angle AEB$\" width=\"135\" height=\"13\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/3/573d576e64f84803ecdff860fec1b26980a04e9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABE \\sim \\triangle FCB$\" width=\"142\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/1/b9143280880d7e69cfb0061c9c8977cd4f15ff2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AB}{FC} = \\frac{BE}{CB} = \\frac{EA}{BF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"145\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/4/e54c5f4298b65e5680faa094f6a2620e36d6e564.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{FC} = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{2} = \\frac{1}{BF}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"140\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>From those two equations, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/f/32f4b7681eb35963a2515211b57ca70bf98214bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CF = \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"79\" height=\"41\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/e/24e9272c42ce7ab815db5e33592472d1da435683.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BF = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"80\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>Now that we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/e/65e4f2d5cc59e5ffbed3734130e8c45b643adc91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/d/07d29465728e92952374a857beaee91665d8dbd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CF$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" />, we can find the area of the bottom triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/9/3095b9f9bbe6418e3883011ec474e7418fb05fab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CFB$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />:  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/6/b86e22b779643f5369a83a831f104282e478a68f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{5}} \\cdot \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} = \\frac{4}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"131\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>The area of left triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/9/409f9059cc97f6eb3fee880d797e27ef4dd80fc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BEA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/f/d5f6a202594b29148b5e0b70c923d151c67da2a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2 \\cdot 1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"90\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>The area of the square is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the area of the remaining quadrilateral is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/a/8ba153cb89daf2e60cffa777880cff12407d413e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 - 1 - \\frac{4}{5} = \\frac{11}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"120\" height=\"37\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Place the square on a coordinate grid so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/d/1fd1ca98e626c085660123908b1f8895269cfe68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/f/3cf942b3a0c850d72358b19ee906a4d110c40502.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D(2,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" />.  Line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7baf95ecafc2d7791788ec79aeeae390d60b119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/d/e8d3f41e4ce3512f73fcda8ef2c9c236f7143a41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" />.  Line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/d/07d29465728e92952374a857beaee91665d8dbd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CF$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> goes through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0c67f1e6c098104b1cb8f1cdd6bb16f689ac3e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and has slope <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/7/a7748d3d38355a68b51bddc29d7647230728287e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" />, so it must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/2/e32ca39622a6b480fa79f58ba3f9f37becd9b042.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1 -\\frac{x}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"77\" height=\"33\" /> \n</p><p>The intersection of the two lines is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> thus has coordinates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/8/6a87815cb1d97f4d98d71007d51f419b24c19aff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{2}{5}, \\frac{4}{5})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"47\" height=\"37\" />.  The altitude from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> thus has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fd03d5b164ae8b40db27a6f8ddb20d9d43f95fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />, so the area of the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/a/89a3f0e3dd12e6a4cc523abc05db1a2bce99298d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCF$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/7/e271671f8fdd08d709e6116301bbf16ea14205b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2\\cdot \\frac{4}{5} = \\frac{4}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"97\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>The other triangle has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the whole square has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  As above, we find the area of the quadrilateral by subtracting the two triangles, and we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/6/2a6fd88c163ca4f35dd1e2d1e30dac4c7cf7a004.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{11}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME\" title=\"1997 AHSME\">1997 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017190245\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 306/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2492/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 150/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8949/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.770      1 -total\n 56.18%    7.174      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 41.46%    5.294      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:9995:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017190245 and revision id 56507. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}